            <note corresp="#d280-f4" n="4" xml:id="d280-f4-content">
                <p>In Sadat’s message, he promised that in
                    preparation for Kissinger’s visit to
                    Cairo, the Egyptians were working out “comprehensive proposals” for a final
                    peace settlement.</p>
            </note>
